GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌Gemini升级支持PDF、表格及代码文件内联编辑与预览</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌Gemini即日起迎来重大功能升级，全面支持在聊天窗口内直接对PDF、谷歌文档、表格、演示文稿、Markdown、TXT及代码文件进行内联编辑与预览。此次更新打通了“生成-修改”闭环，用户无需下载或跳转至外部应用，即可在Gemini界面内全屏编辑文档，或通过选中特定文本直接下达修改指令，例如将表格一键转换为图表。在平台支持方面，PDF预览与编辑功能已同步登陆网页端与移动端，其余格式目前主要支持网页端操作。此次更新将编辑能力直接内嵌至独立聊天界面，相较于此前依赖Workspace侧边栏的集成方式，显著提升了办公与内容创作的交互效率。随着Gemini补齐这一生产力短板，对话式AI作为独立办公工具的边界被进一步拓宽，行业竞争格局持续演进。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达开源语音转录大模型Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe，支持8人同时识别</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正式开源语音转录大模型Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe，该模型采用MoE架构，总参数量340亿，每次前向传播激活43亿参数，在保证推理性能的同时优化了运行效率。该模型单次支持处理长达1小时的连续音频，涵盖40种语言转录及31种语言与英语的双向互译。针对多人对话痛点，模型可同时区分并识别多达8名说话人。在性能表现上，Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe在Open ASR英语组评测中词错误率（WER）低至5.33%，在Artificial Analysis非流式测试中WER进一步降至2.8%，位居开源模型榜首。该模型为开发者提供了处理长音频、会议纪要及跨国交流场景的强力基座，显著提升了多说话人环境下的语音识别准确度与实时归属判定能力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度升级AI搜索及搜索AI API，调用价格低至4.9元/千次</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/832677c3abf303c4a95b4b9406abe79c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百度升级AI搜索及搜索AI API，调用价格低至4.9元/千次AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Oct 30, 202648今日，百度正式宣布升级百度AI搜索和搜索AI API，进一步拓展AI搜索的应用场景，并降低开发者调用成本。此次升级重点涉及API服务及百度App四大AI功能。价格方面，全新升级的搜索AI API在活动期间推出优惠价格，低至4.9元/千次，旨在降低企业和开发者接入AI搜索能力的成本。百度App则围绕文心助手、AI镜头、GUI互动场景和AI互动应用进行升级。其中，文心助手从传统的“一次问答”向“一份交付”转变，覆盖170余种应用场景。AI镜头新增动态追踪功能，并支持9种方言实时对话。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">万亿参数开源模型Mistral Large4 登场：用更少Token打平顶级性能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bc8a0302d9c76c58b966aafbbb70590e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">万亿参数开源模型Mistral Large4 登场：用更少Token打平顶级性能AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Oct 30, 20264110月30日消息，欧洲人工智能领军企业 Mistral 正式开源了其代号为“Le Chonk”的全新旗舰模型 —— Mistral Large4。作为目前开源权重阵营中体量最为庞大的大模型之一，它拥有高达1万亿参数，并且完全在欧洲本土基础设施上从零开始训练而成，标志着开源大模型在迈向万亿规模与多模态原生融合的道路上取得了实质性突破。性能硬刚与Token效率:拒绝单纯刷分，主打极致性价比 在核心能力与基准测试方面，Mistral Large4展现出了极为强悍的竞争力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Neuralink脑机接口接入Grok大模型，实现患者意念唤醒AI与语音通话</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4346e49eb882ea8c7f9302488390c497.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Neuralink近日完成重大技术升级，成功将Grok大模型接入脑机接口系统，使患者能够通过意念直接唤醒AI并执行复杂操作。在针对渐冻症患者Kenneth的72小时闭关开发中，团队推出了8项技术原型，核心突破包括：引入Neural VAD（神经语音活动检测）实现零按键意念触发；通过实时神经信号可视化辅助患者训练；以及将脑机解码语音接入iPhone麦克风音频流，实现意念拨打电话。最显著的进展在于Grok智能体的深度融合，患者仅需默念指令，Grok即可接管屏幕并自动拆解执行复杂任务。该技术通过将大脑的核心意图转化为AI托管的系统级操作，有效解决了脑机接口带宽限制的瓶颈，标志着人机协同从“意念控制光标”向“意念操控智能体”的跨越，为高位截瘫患者提供了更高效的交互与沟通方案。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
